=== . and ..
wbsh: rm: refusing to remove '.' or '..' directory: skipping '..'
rm -rf ..: 1
wbsh: rm: refusing to remove '.' or '..' directory: skipping '.'
rm -rf .: 1
wbsh: rm: refusing to remove '.' or '..' directory: skipping 'keep/sub/..'
rm -rf keep/sub/..: 1
wbsh: rm: refusing to remove '.' or '..' directory: skipping 'keep/./'
rm -r keep/./: 1
wbsh: rm: cannot remove '..': Is a directory
rm .. without -r: 1
keep/k.txt keep/sub
=== filesystem root
wbsh: rm: it is dangerous to operate recursively on 'X:/'
wbsh: rm: use --no-preserve-root to override this failsafe
rm -rf X:/: 1
=== -f and missing files
rm -f nope: 0
rm -f with no operand: 0
wbsh: rm: cannot remove 'nope': No such file or directory
rm nope: 1
rm -rf nope/deeper: 0
wbsh: rm: missing operand
rm: 1
wbsh: rm: invalid option -- 'q'
rm -q: 1
=== read-only files go away
rm read-only: 0
rm -r read-only inside: 0
keep
=== -f does not hide real errors
wbsh: rm: cannot remove 'prot/f': Permission denied
rm -f locked: 1
wbsh: rm: cannot remove 'prot/f': Permission denied
rm -rf locked + other: 1
prot/f kept
other removed
cleanup: 0
